    ],
    "summary": "Your DS stylus has been magically infused with the power to paint! When\nKirby gets turned into a ball by an evil witch, your hand-drawn rainbow\npaths become the only way he can find power-ups and reach the gates of\neach world. Draw loops to make him speed up, make ramps to jump danger,\nand draw walls to block laser beams and cannon blasts as you explore\nseven levels packed with adventure.\n\nKirby: Canvas Curse delivers all of the classic copying action Kirby\nfans expect, while utilizing some of the most innovative touch-screen\ncontrols we've seen on Nintendo DS. Don't let Kirby's pink exterior fool\nyou -- Canvas Curse is a perfectly balanced game that challenges players\nof all skill levels.",
